---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Reads recent runtime logs for an environment (pass `--follow` to stream)

Usage: logs [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -f, --follow
          Continuously poll for new runtime log lines

      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --process <PROCESS>
          Filter to a single process (e.g. `app` or a service name)

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --since-minutes <SINCE_MINUTES>
          Only include lines from the last N minutes

      --contains <CONTAINS>
          Only include lines containing this substring

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

      --limit <LIMIT>
          Maximum lines per page

  -h, --help
          Print help
